                    <signifLet xml:id="m-410515b8-8477-471c-9b06-1a2180414a04" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-facd73f9-4e2e-44d4-8d0d-bd0fc926d3ac">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-5d58358f-1ab7-41b6-ade5-1121e76cb921" type="punctum" xml:id="m-f7872af3-4b1e-4c3c-8f22-54134422e117">
                  <nc xml:id="m-b0b723bd-bb85-488d-a21a-e4b79f94226c" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-e6edced5-25c9-47e8-9722-7782307159a1">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-9ab26f54-ffc8-4365-93b9-048628331a52" type="punctum" xml:id="m-5601a5b6-2f6a-4ded-8bbb-109a2613315b">
                  <nc xml:id="m-06efe448-dcaa-475c-ae25-695bfb2cd11e" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-7338f9e2-a28a-45a2-97d7-77f61f83a5d9">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-67f97b06-f82f-41fc-bf47-9775f3a76e28" type="punctum" xml:id="m-5d13b146-eaf6-4371-887c-6a7a7ccd83e7">
                  <nc xml:id="m-700f4329-ffd0-4001-9e0b-ec014e7de4c7" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-8efc2d98-6c58-4fe8-b062-2f36306d7a45" facs="#m-c37d24c8-d0f5-4b92-bdc9-1aea81b87861" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c5489208-8a3e-4680-82c1-d133e048dbf6"><lg xml:id="m-d6a53dad-6249-4cf5-8148-f069a636c83f"><l xml:id="m-3dee2e22-d54c-44ff-acae-eedcc0204d94" facs="#m-5110dbb3-2f1f-44ea-a705-b0871d4c4721" label="ambiguous">38*</l><l xml:id="m-f4a298b7-b529-4500-8e36-8c01e1acf04b" facs="#m-4853a27b-d3cb-481d-965d-91f3c9107f49" label="ambiguous">Appendix</l><l xml:id="m-36157383-1715-45b0-8408-fc1c6e147d0e" facs="#m-aad23316-932c-4f40-83bf-e2d7f2667de9" label="lyrics-like">9. Nam ómnes dies nóstri transiérunt in ira túa; * finivimus ánnos</l><l xml:id="m-f25f4035-4102-43a8-8635-1bcffab06fee" facs="#m-8e8eea64-6e63-4d3a-ae69-398ae6d383c3" label="lyrics-like">nóstros ut suspírium.</l><l xml:id="m-ff45e938-93ae-498c-847b-8e5029c801e6" facs="#m-7683b002-ecec-4069-bdc7-0523210b833d" label="lyrics-like">10. Súmma annórum nostrórum sunt septuaginta ánni *et, si válidi</l><l xml:id="m-62d02f0a-9745-4b6b-8572-d81a56f0d9cf" facs="#m-b92c9714-f144-4fe0-880c-63c51a39d181" label="lyrics-like">súmus, octogínta;</l><l xml:id="m-fc74c9ec-c9ec-4e5f-8bb4-ef093e0b08f5" facs="#m-6e368673-9689-43f2-bf0f-77fd28cf70e3" label="lyrics-like">11. Et plerique eórum sunt lábor et vánitas: * nam cíto tránseunt,</l><l xml:id="m-5c7b8efb-7f2a-4d13-9173-eeee59fa2dd3" facs="#m-01b759c0-98c9-4b85-a2fd-64b12d1bd544" label="lyrics-like">et nos avolámus.</l><l xml:id="m-f25fd3c2-dee7-44b8-9ad2-cf51e20508a1" facs="#m-2b949b17-3f9d-4a53-882f-45a8d1ec63c7" label="lyrics-like">12. Quis perpéndit poténtiam irae túae, *et pro débito tibi timóre</l><l xml:id="m-fb0a3a01-fafd-454c-97a8-4440770fe583" facs="#m-198b3f79-6e86-494e-8d62-ba8c04cc33dc" label="lyrics-like">indignatiónem túam?</l><l xml:id="m-f3c77aba-1ce4-4c38-aa3e-e69811850b28" facs="#m-cca831d0-dec1-42ba-827e-a31d3572d4a5" label="lyrics-like">13. Dinumeráre nos dóce dies nóstros, * ut perveniámus ad sapiéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-16460643-fa0b-40fa-ad6a-f5b97d5b2524" facs="#m-1ed9876e-c25f-44c2-8f8a-b457c45c754f" label="lyrics-like">córdis.</l><l xml:id="m-43c26d50-2da6-401c-9304-304970853456" facs="#m-8f94b394-ec8f-4434-927c-660f34b40a5d" label="lyrics-like">14. Revértere, Dómine, — quoúsque? * et propitius ésto sérvis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-81bb08f4-0390-4d14-bdcf-04ae62da469a" facs="#m-6826e1ba-2be8-4cf2-ba2f-10dfa19d5c26" label="lyrics-like">15. Sátia nos cito misericórdia túa, *ut exsultémus et laetémur cúnctis</l><l xml:id="m-d3286736-e0c9-4748-890f-9e0c20bc79fd" facs="#m-ca94865f-994f-4bd2-a6b6-2f493677c35d" label="lyrics-like">diébus nóstris.</l><l xml:id="m-966beec9-a2d7-4b7f-9ad4-070d99089121" facs="#m-ca226cdf-4515-4834-8f53-f1a4f07c1a19" label="lyrics-like">16. Laetifica nos pro diébus quibus nos afflixisti, *pro ánnis quibus</l><l xml:id="m-5db4f5eb-9be8-4179-92eb-9be38864ebc9" facs="#m-aa88d80d-33e0-4e5f-bdd7-1b621402f5a4" label="lyrics-like">vidimus mála.</l><l xml:id="m-6ee8e596-a648-4f5e-8d84-a49939e8db01" facs="#m-51dd0b78-284d-43b9-985a-81b31f13e65f" label="lyrics-like">17. Appáreat sérvis túis ópus túum, * et glória túa filiis eórum,</l><l xml:id="m-961b190c-d9ff-4b6a-b18b-c8b99d56cff4" facs="#m-39773311-1ba5-48c7-8af0-fdf75843e5ce" label="lyrics-like">18. Et bónitas Dómini Déi nóstri sit super nos, t et ópus mánuum</l><l xml:id="m-762bced3-27cc-4b68-9a50-4033091db536" facs="#m-d0563d30-b439-43cd-b556-b16391b5f426" label="lyrics-like">nostrárum secúnda nóbis, * et ópus mánuum nostrárum secúnda.</l><l xml:id="m-e756c713-e4d4-48b8-a631-43e5a19fb261" facs="#m-559aa8b3-9db8-4e8d-858e-2d5b517d08f5" label="ambiguous">Psalm 35</l><l xml:id="m-e72d4a02-b665-49db-b133-62ea485b3429" facs="#m-e9d21032-ecf3-47e5-aae0-688f7e798f00" label="lyrics-like">1. Lóqui-tur in-íqui-tas ad impi-um in córde é¬jus; " non est tímor</l><l xml:id="m-f5c2beec-a63b-4c35-b8be-dd6d2bec3541" facs="#m-f387b529-1079-462a-9d1a-896c2539f35d" label="lyrics-like">Dé-i ante ócu los é¬ jus. Flex: De-i, t</l><l xml:id="m-1bb633a1-bf7a-424e-87c1-62284b9c6478" facs="#m-5d6a4f6b-c6a0-4ebc-8b11-2919062af3f3" label="lyrics-like">2. Etenim in ménte súa blanditur sibi"non deprehéndi cúlpam</l><l xml:id="m-7fea20cd-bd58-4397-a59a-3b430304843a" facs="#m-f19f8a75-0ff1-4b3e-84fd-44b09ca24921" label="lyrics-like">súam neque abhorréri.</l><l xml:id="m-23d80652-3d21-4c6a-b9c0-8c98a9d0ceb7" facs="#m-322d011a-1227-4258-8fd8-9cebacec6a18" label="lyrics-like">3. Vérba óris éjus iniquitas et dólus, * désiit sápere et âgere béne.</l><l xml:id="m-11595782-1148-43fd-899c-dd0bd9ea86df" facs="#m-322a2148-f23a-4631-9770-9e60315e7bde" label="lyrics-like">4. Iniquitátem meditátur in cubili súo, f consístit in via non bóna, "</l><l xml:id="m-55bd241e-65f4-4353-a26d-f3c0273dff95" facs="#m-6270292c-1d76-4344-8c56-8cc861c704ac" label="lyrics-like">málum non aversátur.—</l><l xml:id="m-8a208317-ab2b-4c79-9835-1ecfbf87701b" facs="#m-326a2c57-d942-49d8-a47e-0d72f2fd2220" label="lyrics-like">5. Dómine, caélum contingit misericórdia túa,*fidélitas túa ipsas</l><l xml:id="m-200bb887-e748-469e-a138-c85ce1dd4d58" facs="#m-33542271-8551-4310-bc52-5e1043f25b69" label="lyrics-like">núbes.</l><l xml:id="m-132f026a-9006-4351-8548-4a4869742ae3" facs="#m-d0ec0605-b846-437d-b688-d9c378d01c85" label="lyrics-like">6. Justitia túa sicut móntes Déi, f judícia túa sicut máre profúndum:</l><l xml:id="m-22638b3c-9ce3-4a95-95be-8381e9a29142" facs="#m-b06ee980-8e08-4456-b02f-b372642ad755" label="lyrics-like">hómines et juménta sálvas, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-b137ed06-9ae7-4a36-bdad-85955bdbe9ce" facs="#m-006d41e4-800d-43ae-9b5d-5920c90584ca" label="lyrics-like">7. Quam pretiósa est grátia túa, Déus: " filii hóminum sub úmbram</l><l xml:id="m-bc3f5fa9-de4e-4f6e-ab9d-fafe4368f53d" facs="#m-c1a6f7c4-6633-40ed-97c1-c9a8af2d9073" label="lyrics-like">alárum tuárum confúgiunt;</l><l xml:id="m-ba82670a-89f0-4005-a162-ec5783c99c41" facs="#m-e39d5a3f-536b-4c02-98e1-212d66f3d8ea" label="lyrics-like">8. Satiántur pinguédine dómus túae, *et torrénte deliciárum tuárum</l><l xml:id="m-a798a43b-03ba-4ef8-8beb-b47db693a447" facs="#m-2c91aa4a-5e8d-41ea-ba99-6d2c76709946" label="lyrics-like">pótas éos.</l><l xml:id="m-630570bc-266a-45e1-ad30-ed284a4f1785" facs="#m-8d550574-3261-42c3-a568-3e419226ddf9" label="lyrics-like">9. Etenim apud te est fons vitae, * et in lúmine túo vidémus lúmen.—</l><l xml:id="m-d8f74c0b-d3f9-4a78-8750-cbe1887d0bd6" facs="#m-38023af5-c9ee-4a10-b21b-714d1bab462c" label="lyrics-like">10. Sérva grátiam túam sis qui te cólunt, * et aequitátem túam si</l><l xml:id="m-1ea8e992-9693-436f-8c5c-54de15dccb18" facs="#m-ec7aeb3c-79d2-43ef-a14d-d21075087fc0" label="lyrics-like">qui récto sunt córde.</l><l xml:id="m-ed2fdc54-c187-4eae-90a1-60c5fe9aee6a" facs="#m-44dd7bd9-f780-4786-af47-63fc25d4950e" label="lyrics-like">11. Ne supervéniat mihi pes supérbi, * et mánus peccatóris ne móvea</l><l xml:id="m-82559bdf-ff5b-436b-b78f-ba562ee3ea2f" facs="#m-8621b747-7fbd-4c07-98dc-aff2f31e824a" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-dbd550db-3c53-4826-8c94-65f7ec3e96d7" facs="#m-42304550-eae9-4e05-b97f-69a6ba259bed" label="lyrics-like">12. Ecce corruérunt qui pátrant iniquitátem: * dejécti sunt nec súrger</l><l xml:id="m-f2f3f66e-c0bf-4e1a-b3a3-2c6678a87f0e" facs="#m-f7701d00-8367-445e-a2ef-6ad666851052" label="lyrics-like">póesunt.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>